B.a29=new A.U("Pacific Coast Golden Hour","#PUB_LOUNGE","\ud391\ud06c \ud31d",104,"West Coast nu disco funk pop, groovy syncopated bass guitar, crisp funky rhythm guitar, warm analog synth pads, smooth soulful English male falsetto vocal, upscale rooftop lounge at sunset, filtered intro that opens up, chorus with stacked falsetto harmonies, bridge with synth and handclaps, tight punchy low end, 104 bpm, sung in English","[Verse 1]\nAmber reflections on the glass skyline\nCool ocean breeze coming right on time\nWe got the rooftop view and the stereo low\nWatching the city put on a golden show\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nStep into the rhythm let the tension fade\nBest kind of memories are about to be made\n\n[Chorus]\nCruising through the Pacific Coast golden hour\nFeeling that electric sunset power\nKeep the groove locked in never let it go\nDancing in the warmth of the evening glow\n\n[Outro]\nGolden hour fading into night\nEverything is feeling just right")
B.a2f=new A.U("Velvet Skylight","#PUB_LOUNGE","\ub525 \ud558\uc6b0\uc2a4",120,"sophisticated vocal deep house, warm plucked synth bass with controlled sub frequencies, crisp four on the floor house drums, atmospheric lush synth chords, hypnotic airy English female vocal, luxury cocktail lounge, long atmospheric intro, vocal hook repeats over a building groove, filtered breakdown then the beat returns, 120 bpm, sung in English","[Verse 1]\nShadows moving softly across the floor\nLeave the heavy world outside the door\nSilver echoes floating in the air\nNothing else can touch us while we are there\n\n[Chorus]\nUnderneath the velvet skylight\nWe are drifting through the midnight\nFollow the pulse follow the sound\nHigher than the city lights on the ground\n\n[Outro]\nDrifting through the midnight\nUnderneath the velvet skylight")
